   "html": "<div class=\"build\"><p class=\"label\">Build the oak from a Y and an oval</p><div class=\"panels\"><figure class=\"panel\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1. A trunk that splits in a Y\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-blog-oak-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M 46 82 L 47 64 L 39 53 L 43 51 L 50 59 L 57 51 L 61 53 L 53 64 L 54 82 Z\" fill=\"#3e3428\" stroke=\"var(--ultramarine)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.2 1.6\"/><path d=\"M 50 80 L 50 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-blog-oak-tree)\"/></svg><figcaption><b>1</b> A trunk that splits in a Y</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"panel\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"2. One wide oval on top\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-blog-oak-tree-1\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M 46 82 L 47 64 L 39 53 L 43 51 L 50 59 L 57 51 L 61 53 L 53 64 L 54 82 Z\" fill=\"#3e3428\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-opacity=\".45\" stroke-width=\".7\"/><ellipse cx=\"50.0\" cy=\"42.0\" rx=\"40.0\" ry=\"24.0\" fill=\"#202b30\" stroke=\"var(--ultramarine)\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.2 1.6\"/></svg><figcaption><b>2</b> One wide oval on top</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"panel\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"3. Bumpy clusters on its edge\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-blog-oak-tree-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M 46 82 L 47 64 L 39 53 L 43 51 L 50 59 L 57 51 L 61 53 L 53 64 L 54 82 Z\" fill=\"